      "writtenOn": "2022-09-09T23:39:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This seems fragile. It\u0027ll break if we ever change the capability output.\n\nMaybe it\u0027s the version_to_ccd mapping. Can we have separate tables for ti50 and cr50?\n\nI think that they already have a ti50 ccd info version 0. I doubt they started from 1. Was ti50 version 0 the same as cr50?",
